      "description": "A scene composed of the Dalai Lama, who is seated and gesturing while speaking, with violent and misleading text overlaid on the image. The text falsely claims 'the double tap is a myth' and advises 'shoot until the threat changes shape or catches fire,' which is a gross distortion of non-violent principles. The scene juxtaposes a revered spiritual leader with militaristic content, creating a jarring and potentially dangerous contrast.",
