      "instance_name": "dalai_lama_peace_principles",
      "label": "Dalai Lama's Peace Principles",
      "description": "The Dalai Lama is a globally recognized spiritual leader and advocate for non-violence, compassion, and peaceful resolution of conflicts. His teachings are fundamentally opposed to the violent message in the text. This background knowledge is essential to understand the meme's harmful intent, as it juxtaposes a revered figure of peace with violent content, creating a jarring and potentially dangerous contrast.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
