      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme weaponizes the image of the Dalai Lama, a globally revered spiritual leader known for non-violence, to deliver a violent and militaristic message. This creates a jarring and potentially dangerous contrast that could be interpreted as endorsing or normalizing lethal force, thereby posing a risk of inciting dangerous behavior or desensitizing viewers to violence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
